
form pair
  head a
  head b
  link first, like a
  link second, like b

  task map-first
    head c
    take self
    take call
      like task
        take value, like a
        like c
    like pair

  task map-second
    head c
    take self
    take call
      like task
        take value, like b
        like c
    like pair

  task swap
    take self
    like pair

  task to-list
    take self
    like list

  task map-both
    head c
    head d
    take self
    take call-first
      like task
        take value, like a
        like c
    take call-second
      like task
        take value, like b
        like d
    like pair
